WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.057 --> 00:00:15.937
watched the alien zoom away on the scooter.

2
00:00:17.018 --> 00:00:18.519
"He's controlling the robots!"

3
00:00:18.979 --> 00:00:19.539
she shouted.

4
00:00:20.439 --> 00:00:21.520
Cozlin looked angry.

5
00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:22.960
"Let's get him!"

6
00:00:25.241 --> 00:00:26.922
The alien glanced over his shoulder.

7
00:00:26.942 --> 00:00:28.443
"Oh no!"

8
00:00:29.423 --> 00:00:31.584
His scooter shot forward with incredible speed.

9
00:00:32.756 --> 00:00:36.778
Roxy and Cozlin chased the alien as he zipped back and forth between large boulders.

10
00:00:38.999 --> 00:00:42.261
He soon arrived at a clearing where other aliens stood near a spaceship.

11
00:00:42.281 --> 00:00:47.504
"They're not Delkorians," Cozlin said.

12
00:00:48.685 --> 00:00:50.165
Roxy and Cozlin approached them.

13
00:00:53.987 --> 00:00:54.428
are you?"

14
00:00:54.928 --> 00:00:56.589
Cozlin asked, looking stern.

15
00:00:57.830 --> 00:00:59.210
An alien stepped forward.

16
00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:01.932
"Please don't hurt us!

17
00:01:02.536 --> 00:01:05.118
My name is Eldin, and we're from the planet Trell."

18
00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:08.501
"What are you doing on Delkor?"

19
00:01:08.881 --> 00:01:09.622
Cozlin asked.

20
00:01:09.642 --> 00:01:15.767
"We've been flying through space," Eldin said, "looking for a new home."

21
00:01:16.888 --> 00:01:18.169
Cozlin narrowed her eyes.

22
00:01:18.189 --> 00:01:23.573
"And you thought you could use those robots to take over Delkor!

23
00:01:25.015 --> 00:01:26.736
Then you could make it your new home!"

24
00:01:28.237 --> 00:01:29.458
Eldin's eyes went wide.

25
00:01:29.478 --> 00:01:31.260
"Absolutely not!

26
00:01:31.692 --> 00:01:33.994
We were trying to get away from the robots on Trell.

27
00:01:34.994 --> 00:01:36.996
We didn't realize one was on our spaceship.

28
00:01:38.136 --> 00:01:40.458
It must have sneaked on while we were evacuating Trell."

29
00:01:40.478 --> 00:01:44.501
"It wasn't just one robot," Roxy said.

30
00:01:44.521 --> 00:01:46.482
"There are lots of them!"

31
00:01:47.803 --> 00:01:48.683
Eldin shook his head.

32
00:01:48.703 --> 00:01:51.986
"There was only one robot on board our spaceship.

33
00:01:53.226 --> 00:01:55.768
It found the ship's controls and crashed the ship here.

34
00:01:57.249 --> 00:01:59.170
Our mechanics are now trying to fix our ship."

35
00:01:59.991 --> 00:02:00.571
He sighed.

36
00:02:02.848 --> 00:02:05.169
"We are so sorry for bringing that robot here."

37
00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:08.291
Cozlin chuckled.

38
00:02:08.931 --> 00:02:11.972
"Don't feel too bad, Eldin.

39
00:02:12.913 --> 00:02:15.674
The robots are annoying, but I can handle them."

40
00:02:17.135 --> 00:02:17.895
Roxy frowned.

41
00:02:17.915 --> 00:02:21.217
"You mean, we can handle them."

42
00:02:21.237 --> 00:02:25.059
"I doubt you can stop them," Eldin said.

43
00:02:25.079 --> 00:02:27.520
"That's why we had to flee Trell.

44
00:02:28.992 --> 00:02:32.735
Those robots took over our entire planet in just a couple of weeks.

45
00:02:33.555 --> 00:02:35.737
And Trell wasn't the first planet they invaded.

46
00:02:36.957 --> 00:02:41.640
They've taken over other planets, and once they invade, they quickly make more robots.

47
00:02:42.381 --> 00:02:43.822
There's no way to stop them."

48
00:02:45.503 --> 00:02:47.084
Roxy gulped and looked at Cozlin.

49
00:02:47.104 --> 00:02:50.706
"I have to help her," Roxy thought.

50
00:02:50.726 --> 00:02:53.829
"Her entire planet is in danger."

51
00:02:53.849 --> 00:02:57.471
"Do you know where the robots first came from?"

52
00:02:57.811 --> 00:02:58.852
Cozlin asked Eldin.

53
00:03:00.048 --> 00:03:01.329
"No," Eldin said.

54
00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:03.851
Cozlin turned to Roxy.

55
00:03:04.612 --> 00:03:05.433
"I have a plan.

56
00:03:05.853 --> 00:03:06.394
Let's go."

57
00:03:07.555 --> 00:03:11.017
Roxy and Cozlin said good-bye to the Trellians and headed back toward the city.

58
00:03:11.037 --> 00:03:17.303
"We have to find the original robot," Cozlin said.

59
00:03:17.323 --> 00:03:21.586
"If we destroy it, all the others will stop working."

60
00:03:21.606 --> 00:03:24.489
"We tried that," Roxy said.

61
00:03:24.509 --> 00:03:27.892
"We don't know which one is the original."

62
00:03:28.992 --> 00:03:32.253
"The original probably isn't here," Cozlin said.

63
00:03:32.273 --> 00:03:34.734
"You heard Eldin's story.

64
00:03:35.574 --> 00:03:38.035
Those robots have invaded other planets.

65
00:03:38.815 --> 00:03:43.216
We have to get a good look at the technology the robots use.

66
00:03:43.236 --> 00:03:45.537
Then we can figure out where they came from."

67
00:03:45.557 --> 00:03:47.517
"Good idea!"

68
00:03:47.857 --> 00:03:48.517
Roxy said.

69
00:03:48.537 --> 00:03:51.278
"Let's get one of the robots we destroyed."

70
00:03:55.819 --> 00:03:57.800
Roxy and Cozlin flew back to the city.

71
00:04:00.576 --> 00:04:04.297
By now all the vehicles were gone, but robots were still everywhere.

72
00:04:04.317 --> 00:04:10.860
"The robots must have turned all the vehicles into other robots," Cozlin said.

73
00:04:10.880 --> 00:04:14.401
"That's not all they did," Roxy said.

74
00:04:14.421 --> 00:04:19.643
"Look around There are no more broken robots.

75
00:04:21.103 --> 00:04:23.444
They must have turned them into new robots as well!"
